{
 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces carried out sweeping overnight raids and arrests across the occupied West Bank on Friday, Shehab Wire reported. Operations that began Thursday night and continued into Friday morning targeted towns, villages, and refugee camps across multiple governorates. The incursions resulted in the arrest of at least seven Palestinians, according to the agency.\n\nThe raids were part of a broader pattern of military operations across scattered locations throughout the West Bank. Forces entered residential areas in several districts as part of what Israeli authorities characterize as counterinsurgency sweeps, though specifics on the locations targeted and identities of those detained were not immediately detailed.",
